id: pm-larv4r
title: Make every failing health verdict self-indexing and attach gate severity to findings
description: "GH-1001 shows ok:false can coexist with checks that appear healthy because the deciding provenance warning lives only in a distant top-level array. Add a compact failed_because contract adjacent to the verdict, attach every warning to an owning or synthetic check, distinguish advisory from gate-failing findings, and require executable remediation for every failing class."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: agent-ux,health,output-contract,recovery
