completed_at: "2026-08-15T03:01:43.618Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: "Every ok:false health payload names its deciding codes beside ok; every warning is indexed by a check and declares advisory or gate_failing severity; every gate-failing code has executable remediation or an explicit safe-disposition refusal; compact and full JSON/TOON projections preserve the verdict explanation; GH-1001 is linked in evidence"
parent: pm-33cw
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "Every failing health verdict names its deciding codes, owning checks, severity, and safe remediation disposition in compact and full projections."
actual_result: "Health now emits findings and failed_because consistently, with generated codes and executable remediation or explicit no-safe-automation disposition."
