comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-13T22:03:57.836Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status search found the legacy provenance disposition and remediation registry work, but no item owns self-indexing health verdict causality; GH-1001 is the canonical external report."
  "2026-08-14T23:25:35.706Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-15: active in the coupled workspace-integrity tranche spanning provenance repair, self-indexing health severity, extension-host version coherence, cross-version history repair, and strict linked-artifact parsing. Only these five canonical regression items are claimed; all other tracker work remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-08-15T01:56:45.316Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-08-15: every retained health warning now produces a coded self-indexing finding with check ownership, severity, and either an executable remediation or explicit no-safe-automation disposition; failed_because persists through compact projections. Generated catalogs and public SDK contracts were refreshed. Focused linked tests passed 60/60; manual packed health proved findings and failed_because arrays; full release verification passed 7,334 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-08-15T02:58:02.317Z","harness:codex","PR #1016 review evidence 2026-08-15: full, brief, and summary health projections now retain structured findings for every deciding failed_because warning even when the top-level warning sample is truncated at 100. A 101-warning negative control proves owning check, severity, and remediation disposition remain adjacent to the failing verdict. Focused tests and exact 7,337-test 100/100/100/100 coverage pass."
  "2026-08-15T03:01:42.745Z","harness:codex","Final review evidence: linked health contracts passed 61/61 tests. A deciding failed finding is retained even when it falls beyond the warning sample."
